name=VWP2GoM - Vanilla Weapons Plus to Guns of Marz
id=VWP2GoM
description=Converts the Vanilla Weapons Plus (Gunworks Edition) guns, magazines, attachments, bayonets and ammo in a save, including the vanilla ones it reworks, into their Guns of Marz equivalents, keeping loaded ammo, condition, attachments, names and slots. Enable together with Gunworks-gang and Guns of Marz. Also enable VWP2GoM Placeholders in the load where Vanilla Weapons Plus is removed, and keep both enabled afterwards.
author=Tien
modversion=1.0.0
require=SWMG,GunsOfMarz
loadModAfter=SWMG,GunsOfMarz,MarzVanillaGuns
category=Weapons
